flowchart TD
    Start([User Opens DM Inbox]) --> Init[Initialize Component]
    Init --> CheckKey{Active Key<br/>Available?}

    CheckKey -->|No| ShowKeyError[Display Key Setup Required]
    ShowKeyError --> End([End])

    CheckKey -->|Yes| Subscribe[Subscribe to DM Events]
    Subscribe --> SubSuccess{Subscription<br/>Successful?}

    SubSuccess -->|No| ShowSubError[Display Connection Error]
    ShowSubError --> Retry{User Retries?}
    Retry -->|Yes| Subscribe
    Retry -->|No| End

    SubSuccess -->|Yes| ReceiveEvents[Receive DM Events]
    ReceiveEvents --> DecryptLoop[Decrypt Each Message]
    DecryptLoop --> GroupThreads[Group by Thread ID]
    GroupThreads --> SortThreads[Sort by Latest Message]
    SortThreads --> DisplayList[Display Thread List]

    DisplayList --> UserAction{User Action}

    UserAction -->|Select Thread| ShowConvo[Display Conversation]
    ShowConvo --> UserConvoAction{User Action}

    UserConvoAction -->|Type Message| ComposeMsg[Show Message Composer]
    ComposeMsg --> SendMsg{User Sends?}
    SendMsg -->|Yes| ValidateMsg{Message Valid?}
    ValidateMsg -->|No| ShowValidError[Show Validation Error]
    ShowValidError --> ComposeMsg
    ValidateMsg -->|Yes| EncryptMsg[Encrypt with NIP04]
    EncryptMsg --> CreateEvent[Create Kind 4 Event]
    CreateEvent --> PublishEvent[Publish to Relays]
    PublishEvent --> PubSuccess{Publish<br/>Successful?}
    PubSuccess -->|Yes| OptimisticUpdate[Update UI Optimistically]
    OptimisticUpdate --> ShowConvo
    PubSuccess -->|No| ShowPubError[Show Publish Error]
    ShowPubError --> SendMsg

    UserConvoAction -->|Back| DisplayList
    UserConvoAction -->|Delete| ConfirmDelete{Confirm<br/>Delete?}
    ConfirmDelete -->|Yes| DeleteThread[Clear Thread History]
    DeleteThread --> DisplayList
    ConfirmDelete -->|No| ShowConvo

    UserConvoAction -->|Mark Read| UpdateReadStatus[Update Last Read Time]
    UpdateReadStatus --> ClearBadge[Clear Unread Badge]
    ClearBadge --> ShowConvo

    UserAction -->|Search| FilterThreads[Filter Thread List]
    FilterThreads --> DisplayFiltered[Display Filtered Results]
    DisplayFiltered --> UserAction

    UserAction -->|Refresh| Subscribe
    UserAction -->|Close| Cleanup[Unsubscribe & Cleanup]
    Cleanup --> End

    style Start fill:#4F46E5,stroke:#312E81,color:#fff
    style End fill:#EF4444,stroke:#991B1B,color:#fff
    style EncryptMsg fill:#10B981,stroke:#065F46,color:#fff
    style PublishEvent fill:#10B981,stroke:#065F46,color:#fff
    style OptimisticUpdate fill:#F59E0B,stroke:#92400E,color:#fff
